I understand, @5ce1F. But say my doctor agrees cleansing is safe for me; isn't once-in-a-blue-moon cleansing alright to support overall health maintenance alongside an ongoing healthy lifestyle?

@5ce1F: Indeed, having medical consent makes sense, especially considering individual health factors unique to each person. However, the idea of integrating occasional cleansing within broader holistic care resonates with balancing immediate benefits against long-term maintenance strategies.

It seems we’re exploring this concept thoughtfully, respecting

